        "created_at": "2014-01-12T02:58:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi Rabit!&nbsp; You are so right!&nbsp;</p><p>My little girl and I were feeling strong after Ambuscade, so we decided to take on La Capitan.&nbsp; Oh boy.</p><p>Well, it seemed like no time had passed and there was about 7 minions out there, all pounding us to death.&nbsp; Somehow we survived, and she once again played End of Days and wiped out everything.&nbsp; Then we were able to focus on La Capitan, but she was hitting us back.&nbsp; Then my daughter got down to 3 hit point, and then she played Wrathful Retribution - awesome!&nbsp; Somehow, we wound up winning, I had 1 HP and she had 3.</p>",
