        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-12T03:49:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"SuperRick\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/superrick/48/2705_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> SuperRick:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hi Rabit!&nbsp; You are so right!&nbsp;My little girl and I were feeling strong after Ambuscade, so we decided to take on La Capitan.&nbsp; Oh boy.Well, it seemed like no time had passed and there was about 7 minions out there, all pounding us to death.&nbsp; Somehow we survived, and she once again played End of Days and wiped out everything.&nbsp; Then we were able to focus on La Capitan, but she was hitting us back.&nbsp; Then my daughter got down to 3 hit point, and then she played Wrathful Retribution - awesome!&nbsp; Somehow, we wound up winning, I had 1 HP and she had 3.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Welcome from me, too!</p>\n<p>Yeah, La Capitán makes for some tense games. When it comes to telling an interesting story, I think she ranks in my top 3. Congratulations on the win. I wish I could say I was so lucky my first time.</p>",
