        "id": 86462,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-12T18:55:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Lol, sounds like you're having some fun games with Fanatic there :). Akash'Bhuta is a prime target for End of Days as well, once she gets a bunch of limbs out. We were once fighting her and she had quite a few limbs out so we decided \"Okay, let's just End of Days it because we won't lose <span class=\"bbcode-i\">that</span> much stuff and she'll take a load of damage…\". She also had By Any means on her (one of Chrono Ranger's bounties which causes its target to take +1 damage from everything), so when we used End of Days we conveniently decided to destroy all the limbs first, [/i]then[/i] By Any Means, meaning that she hit herself for +1 damage for every limb destroyed. End damage total was something like 105 or something, which left her on about 42hp. Satisfying! :D.</p>",
